WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:09.100
Your own learning
This is the administrator's personal learning space. Courses you have joined as a learner appear here. Previewing a course does not enrol you.

2
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:16.500
Read your progress
Each course card shows its title and available progress information. Use the progress summary to see how much tracked learning is complete.

3
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Explore a course outline
Expand the course outline to see its weeks and activities. This helps you check the content before continuing your learning.

4
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:32.947
Continue and refresh
Continue learning opens the learner course pages. Refresh updates your courses. If loading fails, Try again retries the request.
